        <mxCell id="JAJbz_dtL72cnFMbcgno-165" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;size=18;" value="&lt;b&gt;QUESTION SCORING COMMENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expected Information Gain&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;IG(q) = H(C) − Σₐ P(a|q) H(C|a,q)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Select: q* = arg max_q IG(q)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;H(C) = −Σc P(c) log₂ P(c)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Terms&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C: remaining candidate members&lt;br&gt;q: candidate question&lt;br&gt;a: possible answer&lt;br&gt;P(a|q): probability of answer a&lt;br&gt;H(C|a,q): uncertainty after answer&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Choose the question with the greatest expected reduction in uncertainty. After each response, update candidate probabilities using Bayesian updating." vertex="1">
